                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17042442" author="zjffdu" created="Sat, 22 Feb 2020 08:09:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Issue resolved by pull request 3656&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3656&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3656&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17519546" author="JIRAUSER286905" created="Fri, 8 Apr 2022 12:27:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This commit only fixed the classloader problem for scala 2.11, while Spark 3.x with scala 2.12 still has this problem.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve tracked down the reason why scala 2.12 cannot be fixed by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3656/files#diff-dd3e9f82ce7302e67306090c8380e0e7f85b82c7544c05be3233b311a9ff9a34R100&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;setting the thread context classloader&lt;/a&gt;: IMain.setContextClassLoader was deprecated and became a no-op in scala 2.12, so the interpreter &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/master/spark/scala-2.12/src/main/scala/org/apache/zeppelin/spark/SparkScala212Interpreter.scala#L229&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;silently skipped setting the thread context classloader&lt;/a&gt;, then weird things happen.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Changing `intp.setContextClassLoader()` to `Thread.currentThread.setContextClassLoader(intp.classLoader)` seems to fix the problem. I&apos;ve tested my fix locally on Spark 3.1.2, I&apos;ll submit a PR if this approach is considered OK.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17519854" author="zjffdu" created="Sat, 9 Apr 2022 01:21:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Kontinuation&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kontinuation&quot;&gt;Kontinuation&lt;/a&gt;&#160; Looking forward your PR&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
